---
title: Leave request
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph Employee
        start([Wants time off]) --> ask[Ask for leave]
        other[Pick other dates]
    end
    subgraph Manager
        enough{Enough days left?}
        covered{Team covered?}
        approve[Approve]
    end
    subgraph HR
        book[Book the days]
        done([Leave booked])
    end
    ask --> enough
    enough -->|yes| covered
    enough -->|no| other
    covered -->|yes| approve
    covered -->|no| other
    other --> ask
    approve --> book
    book --> done
